MaleCNS v1.0 runtime asset
--------------------------

The file `Mod/connectome/malecns-v1.0.flyb.gz` is a prepared derivative of the
MaleCNS v1.0 adult male Drosophila central nervous system connectome. The Male
CNS data is provided under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0). Source and required attribution:

  MaleCNS connectome, FlyEM Project Team at HHMI Janelia Research Campus,
  Drosophila Connectomics Group at the University of Cambridge and MRC LMB,
  and Google Research, dataset `male-cns:v1.0`.
  https://male-cns.janelia.org/
  https://male-cns.janelia.org/download/

The prepared derivative was obtained from the openly published reference
pipeline at https://github.com/blendi-remade/fly-brain-minecraft and is
documented in `docs/PROVENANCE.md`. This repository does not include any code
from that project; the FLYB reader is an independent C# implementation of the
published binary layout.

Relevant research references:

  Berg et al., “Sexual dimorphism in the complete Drosophila male central
  nervous system connectome,” Cell 189(18), 2026,
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015
  Shiu et al., “A Drosophila computational brain model reveals sensorimotor
  processing,” Nature 634, 2024,
  https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-024-07763-9
  Plaza et al., “neuPrint: An open access tool for EM connectomics,” Frontiers
  in Neuroinformatics 16, 2022,
  https://doi.org/10.3389/fninf.2022.896292

People Playground is a separate product and trademark of Studio Minus. Its API
documentation was consulted for the mod folder and entry-point convention only.
